==English==
{{wikipedia|Styx (mythology)}}
{{wikipedia|Styx (moon)}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|Στύξ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/stɪks/|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|sticks}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|Greek mythology}} The river, in [[Hades]], over which the [[soul]]s of the dead are [[ferried]] by [[Charon]].
# {{lb|en|astronomy}} The 5th [[moon]] of [[Pluto]], discovered in 2012.

